			"notes": "# Developer Mode (Not intended for normal usage)\n - Added a developer mode (CTRL + SHIFT + F):\n This mode gives more information about what the mod is doing behind the scenes. It also allows you to bypass the version limitations placed on Replay Recording conversions. \n - Version bump to v1.6.0.3\n\n**THIS MODE IS NOT INTENDED TO BE A WAY TO BYPASS VERSION LIMITATIONS. IT IS STRICTLY MADE TO TEST WHICH VERSIONS WORK!**\n\nVersion limitations were placed to prevent useless bug reports from being made if their older recordings did not convert on newer versions.\n\nYou will not receive support if you use this mode to bypass version limitations."
		},
