			"notes": "# 26.2 Port + Bug Fixes\n - Ported 26.2 from 1.21.11\n - 26.2 now shares code with 1.21.11\n - New 26.2 World Format\n - API renames for 26.2\n - Chunk formatting fix for 26.2\n - Building now requires Java 25 instead of Java 21. \n - Gradle 9.8.2\n - Updated README to include instructions on how to build.\n - Added a version check to detect the version of the recording.\n - Added a warning message telling users to use a newer/older version of Replay To World to convert newer/older versions of Replay Recordings.\n - Removed the chat messages that would appear after converting.\n - Fixed \"Done!\" & \"Failed\" text going off screen.\n - Fixed double clicking a ReplayMod Recording would open the recording instead of converting it.\n - Failed conversions show in log\n - Diagnostic Mode: Toggle on the Replay To World Screen using CTRL + SHIFT + D, shows the conversion process in log. Expect new changes as I have not tested this as much.\n - Updated fabric.mod.json to have the license link instead of just saying MIT\n - Updated fabric.mod.json to include PearitX2 as one of the authors."
